<view class="page data-v-dec401fb"><view class="hero data-v-dec401fb"><text class="hero-title data-v-dec401fb">故障报修</text><text class="hero-sub data-v-dec401fb">柜机异常？提交后运营会尽快处理</text></view><view class="card data-v-dec401fb"><text class="field-label data-v-dec401fb">柜机编号</text><input class="input data-v-dec401fb" placeholder="例如 CAB-001" value="{{a}}" bindinput="{{b}}"/><text class="field-label data-v-dec401fb">问题类型</text><view class="issue-grid data-v-dec401fb"><view wx:for="{{c}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="b" class="{{['issue-chip', 'data-v-dec401fb', item.c && 'active']}}" bindtap="{{item.d}}">{{item.a}}</view></view><text class="field-label data-v-dec401fb">补充说明（选填）</text><block wx:if="{{r0}}"><textarea class="textarea data-v-dec401fb" maxlength="200" placeholder="描述具体情况，便于快速处理" value="{{d}}" bindinput="{{e}}"/></block><button class="btn-primary data-v-dec401fb" hover-class="btn-hover" loading="{{g}}" bindtap="{{h}}">{{f}}</button><text wx:if="{{i}}" class="err data-v-dec401fb">{{j}}</text></view></view>